  _dialogueTexts:
  - I am the sum of contradictions. Humble yet complex.
  - They call me common food , yet I am neither a snack or a meal.
  - I am the last thing you would choose,yet the first things you would miss.
  - I am older than you think , yet younger than what created me.
  - I am not what I seem,yet I am exactly what I am.
  - Tell me,thief...
  - Who Am I?
