  _dialogueTexts:
  - Ah. There you are
  - I know who you are
  - You're an artist.
  - And a thief...but let's stay postive!
  - At the end of this building,in the final room,there are paintings.Valuable ones.
  - And also few steampunk artifacts along the way,don't forget those.
  - You have a habit on getting distracted by aesthetics...
  - Steal everything worth stealing.
  - Try not to get detected,they're not friendly.
  - Oh,go back to that vending machine over there , you'll get a random power-up!
  - 'Possible outcomes include:'
  - 'Speed Boost : Increases your movement speed for 5 seconds.'
  - 'Vitality : Restores 1 health.'
  - 'Shield : Blocks one incoming hit.'
  - 'Cloaking Eye : enemies cannot detect you for 5 seconds.'
  - 'Sensor Ghosting : Reduce enemy FOV for 5 seconds.'
  - Use wisely.
  _durations:
